Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:06.61,top,Sylvia,0,0,0,,As for Twilight's mission next week...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:07.23,sign_102_1_WISE_Safe_House_,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,290)\fnGeorgia\fsp3\blur.5\fad(524,515)}WISE Safe House G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.15,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,To ensure we take every \Nprecaution, as proposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.15,0:00:14.78,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,it'll be a joint mission with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:19.91,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:21.25,main,Nightfall/Fiona,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:25.12,italicstop,Narrator,0,0,0,,A clerk at Berlint General \NHospital, Fiona Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:25.12,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(510,280)\fs14\blur2\fnGeorgia\fsp.3\fad(522,1)}Berlint General Hospital Clerk\N{\fs24}Fiona Frost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:28.13,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,She is a WISE spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.34,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Tell Twilight about this, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.76,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,You two can decide how \Nyou'll carry out the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:33.75,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:38.35,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Take care not to let this become \Na hindrance to Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:41.27,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,How is Strix's progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.52,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Slow and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.41,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,But it was expected to be a \Nlong-term plan to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:51.94,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry. If only I had been \Navailable when this mission started,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:55.07,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I could have supported \Nhim by playing his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.74,0:00:58.74,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Actually, it's still not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:03.08,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Eden will find it suspicious \Nif he suddenly remarries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:07.21,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,There are certain advantages to\Nusing her because she's a local.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.17,0:01:10.00,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The Forger family will stay as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:13.26,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,You concentrate on your own work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.81,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But if Mrs. Forger just happened \Nto retire, that position
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.81,0:01:18.85,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,would have to be filled, would it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:22.60,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What? Don't get any ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:23.85,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.06,0:01:26.10,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:34.11,main,Wise employee B,0,0,0,,Yikes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:35.24,main,Wise employee A,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:39.49,main,Wise employee A,0,0,0,,I guess she'd even try to swipe \NTwilight's glory to get ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:42.83,main,WISE employee B,0,0,0,,She wouldn't hesitate to \Nstab any of us in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:46.08,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,A wicked, cold-blooded, brazen woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.08,0:01:49.17,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,This woman who would carry out any \Nmission without batting an eye
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.17,0:01:50.96,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,made those around her uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:53.96,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Codename: Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:57.51,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,This woman has ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:02:00.97,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(390,126)}NIGHTFALL
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:05.43,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:08.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.48,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:14.48,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.44,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:20.53,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:23.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.58,0:02:32.33,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.33,0:02:39.26,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:46.14,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:52.06,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:58.07,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:04.33,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:12.46,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:24.64,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:40.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I failed at making breakfast again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:54.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid had to make lunch for us yet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:59.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I hope I can make something \Nother than stew well soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I wonder who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.06,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.11,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:19.73,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon. \NI'm a colleague of Dr. Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:21.69,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,My name is Fiona Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:23.03,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, you work with Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:24.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:29.03,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My h-husband is out walking \Nour dog with our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:30.58,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:33.17,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'm very aware that he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:37.67,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,The other day, your daughter \Nvisited our hospital and forgot this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:39.04,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,so I came to deliver it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:44.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you very kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:50.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,S-Since you're here, why don't you \Ncome in and wait until he returns?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:53.18,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:04:59.65,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.95,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, she's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.08,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:16.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.08,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,What a lovely home you have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:21.55,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Does she think his mistress has shown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:25.47,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Then again, I plan to steal the role of \Nhis wife at the first possible moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:26.97,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,so she's not entirely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, my husband picked out \Nall of the furniture...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:31.43,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Yor Briar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:35.98,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,If you are delaying Operation Strix, \NI'll personally get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:40.98,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But... this woman doesn't seem to \Nhave any flaws in her appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:45.44,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-This is the first guest we've had\Nhere other than Yuri and Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.97,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.78,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm a housewife... I'm a housewife...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:54.29,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But to take care of her myself \Nwould pose too many risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:59.00,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'll have to figure out a way to get \Nher to leave this house on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:06.76,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Your daughter... Anya, was it?\N She seems quite lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:10.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Why, yes. Miss Anya \Nis always full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:15.77,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,It must be quite rough. Don't you \Never get tired of childrearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:18.87,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,She is but your stepdaughter, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:21.81,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,You could free yourself of \Nthat burden at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:24.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Rough? What would give you that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:27.32,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I think it's wonderful that \Nshe's so full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:30.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I actually don't know what \NI should do when she seems down,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:34.58,main,Yor,0,0,0,,but it's so much fun being with Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.50,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Hmph. So she actually sees \Nherself as that girl's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:44.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, but it does seem a little rough for \NLoid because of everything he has to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:47.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Because I'm so lacking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:48.59,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:52.05,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,You need to acknowledge your flaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.35,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,You are not fit for this mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.51,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:07:01.64,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I did hear Dr. Forger complaining \Nat work that his wife always—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:04.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:04.90,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:06.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:13.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Fiona... What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:15.16,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Hello, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.10,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,He returned sooner than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:21.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,She came to deliver something \Nyou forgot, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:23.57,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's magnifying glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.57,0:07:25.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:28.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She came all the way to my home?\N Is there an emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Your walk didn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:34.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The sky was looking suspiciously dark, \Nso we came back early.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.39,top,Loid,0,0,0,,You could've just given this to me at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.85,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&H3A4A33&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an9\pos(520,85)\bord1.5\3a&H32&\fad(1523,1)}What's the meaning of this,\NAgent Nightfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:43.85,sign_102_1_WISE_Safe_House_,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs9\pos(170,315)\blur1\fad(273,1)}* They are communicating by separating their mouth movements and sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:41.85,top,Nightfall,0,0,0,,It's quite all right. I was running errands,\N and it was on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:43.85,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an7\bord1.5\fad(1523,1)\pos(130,100)}I just wanted to confirm\N Operation Strix's progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:47.15,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Th-This lady is a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:54.87,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&H3A4A33&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an7\bord1.5\fad(1523,1)\pos(65,200)}Confirm?\N Confirm what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:49.99,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, the supermarket on 2nd Street?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:51.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What is she up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:54.87,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Agents should avoid unnecessary \Ncontact with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:58.74,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,The onions were on sale there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:08:00.37,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an7\bord1.5\fad(1523,1)\pos(192,133)}Agent Twilight,\Nis walking the\Ndog crucial to\N the operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:04.38,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Perhaps I'll go buy some, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:09.38,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an9\bord1.5\fad(1523,1)\pos(520,140)}Shouldn't you make this\Nwoman run errands like that?\N Is she uncooperative?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:06.96,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Pumpkins and pasta were also on sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.38,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,The registers were a crowded mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:12.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I recommend the shrimp there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:12.38,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&H3A4A33&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an9\bord1.5\3a&H32&\fad(1523,1)\pos(580,243)}...What are you getting at...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:17.60,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I never mentioned this to you, \NDoctor, but I'm allergic to shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:19.39,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an7\bord1.5\fad(1523,1)\pos(163,123)}To think the great\NTwilight is stuck\Nplaying house...\NIt's a disservice\N to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:27.40,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an9\bord1.5\fad(1523,1)\pos(556,144)}I propose that we reevaluate\N this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:27.40,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs20\c&H3A4A33&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an7\bord1.5\3a&H32&\fad(1523,1)\pos(83,191)}This doesn't\N concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.98,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,This lady doesn't get along with Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:29.98,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Is she a bad guy spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.78,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Her face is scary, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.53,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Agent Twilight...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:37.28,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\an7\c&HF3D3F4&\3c&HD15AE9&\4c&HD24BF3&\fad(2000,1)}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:36.78,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:52.72,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I {\i0}wuv{\i1} you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:52.38,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\an7\c&HF3D3F4&\3c&HD15AE9&\4c&HD24BF3&\fad(2000,2000)}I wuuuv
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:52.38,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\an9\c&HF3D3F4&\3c&HD15AE9&\4c&HD24BF3&\fad(2000,2000)}you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.31,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\an7\c&HF3D3F4&\3c&HD15AE9&\4c&HD24BF3&\fad(2000,1)\pos(30,10)}Wuv
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:03.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Mm, this is delicious, Nightfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:04.43,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'm happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:08.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You can cook and do laundry!\N You're just the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.43,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Oh, you flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:11.92,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Ah, Twilight. Here are my \Nearnings for the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:13.40,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Please use them however you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:14.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Nightfall, you're just—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:19.50,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Oh, and I've also researched what kind\N of weapons, as well as the name, age,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:22.11,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,and even how many gray hairs your \Nenemy has in your next mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.11,0:09:24.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Amazing! Absolutely amazing, Nightfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're just so perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Who needs that dumb woman any longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:30.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:33.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,In order to attain true world peace,\N I will marry you, Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:38.47,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Oh, Twilight! I'm all yours,\Nand not just for the mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:45.68,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Codename: Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:50.08,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Her ambition was to become Twilight's bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:53.75,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'm far more qualified to be his wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:57.50,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'd give him all the support he needed\N both on his missions and at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:10:00.50,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Oh, and our honeymoon would \Nbe on some tropical island...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.50,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What in the world is she thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:05.82,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll pour us all some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.11,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Would you like some hot cocoa, Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:10.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:39.52,flashback,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I did hear Dr. Forger complaining \Nat work that his wife always—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:42.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She's always so clumsy and absolutely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:45.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll sell her off to the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.63,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Fiona, would you like to be my wife instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:51.24,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,What, really? Sure, I'll come over sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:11:03.18,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But... I guess I can't blame him \Nfor feeling that way about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:07.37,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't even make breakfast properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:11.04,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hot cocoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:15.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here's some milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:16.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:19.15,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Hmph. Twilight prefers his coffee black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:22.62,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I've never ever seen him add any milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:26.99,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I can't believe you thought you were fit \Nto be his wife without knowing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.21,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Switch with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:29.62,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:34.12,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Impossible! Have Twilight's tastes \Nchanged since he gained a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.59,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,There's a side of Twilight I don't know about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.96,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,A side he only shows this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:43.01,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. This is just a part \Nof his "Loid Forger" character.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:46.04,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,He's perfectly playing the role of \Nsomeone who likes milk in his coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.14,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,It's to go along with this family's setting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:50.25,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Well done, Twilight! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:53.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The milk helps lessen the \Ndamage to my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:57.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Actually, maybe I'll ask her to make \Nme something without caffeine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:11:59.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,This lady is wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.34,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:04.28,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:05.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You didn't get burnt, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I made a little mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:09.91,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Hmph. What a careless child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:15.96,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,If she had been properly trained, \Nshe could've caught the cup before it fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:19.14,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,He must be so busy that \Nhe hasn't had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:23.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, Bond! Don't you dare lick \Nthat up. It's poison to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:24.45,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:29.06,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,In which case, it's the wife's duty to \Nmake their daughter more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:32.43,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,She can't even scold the child. \NTherefore, she's unfit for the role.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.98,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Switch with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:35.75,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,If I were her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:38.29,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I would manage her schedule by the minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:41.39,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,and I would whip that girl into shape,\N both physically and mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:45.07,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,In just a month, I could turn her \Ninto a Stella-winning machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.11,0:12:49.65,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Every fiber of Anya's being \Ndoes not want this mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:54.42,main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs15\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an9\bord1.5\fad(3607,1)\pos(430,40)}Twilight, again, I propose\Nthat I switch places with\N your current wife
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:53.82,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Hot cocoa is very nutritious. \NWhat an excellent choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:03.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ah, Anya suddenly wants Mama to coddle her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:05.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?! Wh-What brought this on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:10.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya loves the mama who cleans up her\N hot cocoa mess the most in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:12.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What kind of reason is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:17.81,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Hmph. I could coddle her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:19.34,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I know, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:22.69,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll bring you \Nsome delicious imported cocoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:24.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:24.19,main,Loid and Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.19,0:13:25.23,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:29.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Perhaps she's nervous because \Nyou've only just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:31.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya, go on and play with Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:32.64,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:36.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has a papa and mama \Nwho get along so good,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:38.77,main,Anya,0,0,0,,and Bond, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:42.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is so happy she's the \NForger family's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:47.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so happy. For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:53.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid! I promise I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:56.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can for you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:58.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll wipe up hot cocoa \Nas much as I need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.41,0:14:00.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:01.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.85,0:14:04.81,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,You should be teaching the girl \Nnot to spill her cocoa at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:06.14,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Switch with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:10.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're already working hard enough, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:13.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's why Anya is so fond of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:16.63,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask you to do anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:20.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:25.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:27.63,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, you already are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:31.00,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,His fake smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:33.28,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,Listen well, Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:37.61,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,A spy must never let \Ntheir true feelings show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.05,flashback,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Yes, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:41.87,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,Kill any emotions. Don't let down your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:46.46,flashback,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Yes, Twilight. I will never let this \Npoker face crack even the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:48.10,flashback,Twilight,0,0,0,,Uh, you don't need to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.59,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Lionel from the national defense forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:53.80,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Lawrence, who works in the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:55.65,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Robert, the secretary of \Na government official.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:59.87,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I know this because I've seen the various \Nversions of Twilight over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.88,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,What a perfectly executed fake smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:12.12,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,And the subtle truth that \Nbleeds through it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:25.16,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Oh, I just realized I forgot to \Nbuy those potatoes I meant to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:28.40,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I should probably take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:31.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Maybe you should wait \Nuntil the rain dies down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:32.94,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.35,main,Anya,0,0,0,,She left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:46.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She didn't have an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:48.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll see her to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:50.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:51.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Do be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:06.19,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:09.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Take this umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:15.36,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Twilight, I forgot to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:20.34,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,The Handler would like us to take \Ncare of this next mission together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:23.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, you need to tell me important \Nthings like that first...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:30.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Nightfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.34,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'm glad it's raining right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.31,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:41.68,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I will conceal these feelings until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:45.36,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'll brief you on the \Ndetails at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:48.90,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Because we are spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:52.81,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Because that's what my \Nbeloved Twilight taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:55.92,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Until this cold war is over...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.40,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:04.85,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:07.14,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I don't care if we're a fake couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:08.85,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I just want to stay by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:12.83,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,You've lost your edge due to \Nplaying house for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:17.21,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I will show him just how capable \NI am on this next mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:20.74,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I ask that you do not hold me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:24.93,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,The only one suited to be your wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:27.24,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:13.96,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(297,165)\fscx60}FIRST FIT OF JEALOUSY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:18.09,italics,TV narrator,0,0,0,,The army cartography \Ncorps Bear Squad is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:21.64,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya, you need to brush \Nyour teeth and go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:22.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:26.14,italics,Squad member,0,0,0,,Captain! It may be dangerous \Nto survey the enemy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This polar bear looks like you, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:29.31,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:32.62,italics,Squad member,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Peggie's been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:35.53,italics,Peggie,0,0,0,,Just leave me behind and go...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:40.30,italics,Peggie,0,0,0,,Promise me... that you'll create the \Npeaceful world we always dreamed of...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:45.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Penguin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:47.08,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on \Nin this grim cartoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:52.42,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Penguin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:57.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to sleep with \NMister Penguin tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:19:59.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:13.17,italics,Bond,0,0,0,,Jealou...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:19.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:24.39,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My penguin's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:31.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Agent Penguin! Who did this to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:34.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,These look like... scratches and bite marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:43.92,italics,Bond,0,0,0,,Penguin bad. Stole Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:45.96,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,So it was you, Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:49.63,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:48.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:53.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I hate you, Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:03.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:07.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll sew him up and make him all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:09.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My penguin will be alive again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.82,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Why did his head break off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:20.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, God! He's even deader!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:26.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Calm down. I'll buy you a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:30.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No! This Mister Penguin is \Nreally important to Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:33.81,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Because you got him for me, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.51,0:21:39.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. I'll fix him up, so you go \Neat and maybe do some homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:17.25,main,Loid,0,0,0,,He's all better, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:24.26,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He looks kind of Frankensteiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.26,0:22:25.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.17,0:22:31.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,S-Scars are medals of valor for soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:36.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Agent Penguin suffered \Nhonorable injuries in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.77,0:22:38.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Medals...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:41.20,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Correct. His scars are \Nnothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:42.58,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.07,0:22:46.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Evil Bond! What do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:48.45,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:52.47,sign_32795_345_Salt_Flavored,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,200)\fad(2151,1)\frz1.97\fax-0.26}SALTY\NFLAVOR!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:51.02,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Peanuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:56.47,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Are you saying sorry to Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:01.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I think he wants you to forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:04.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well? Remember what Bondman said?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:07.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,"Yesterday's enemy is today's ally."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:09.48,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The line from episode eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.77,0:23:22.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I-I was deeply hurt... But I \Nwill call a truce in this war
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:26.26,main,Anya,0,0,0,,on behalf of the peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.26,0:23:27.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:32.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is sorry she said she hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:46.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Now the peace treaty is signed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.64,0:23:47.31,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:23:57.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I wish things could be this easy \Nfor the East and the West, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(265,285)\fscx48}THE UNDERGROUND TENNIS TOURNAMENT: THE CAMPBELLDON
